From: woahwhattheheck <293286387+woahwhattheheck@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 05:36:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Lock drawings to viewports to see several at once

Activating a drawing changed every viewport looking through the scene
camera, and the drawing's isolation hid the elements other viewports
needed. A viewport can now be locked to the drawing it shows from the
lock button in its header. A locked viewport keeps its drawing camera
as local camera and uses local view to show only that drawing's
elements and annotations. Activating another drawing then only changes
the viewport it is activated from, or the first unlocked viewport.
Annotation decorations and cut fills follow each viewport's camera.

Closes #6432.

